                                                "text": "I don't care if it harelips the governor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "458ccfec-0d4d-42d6-b161-45271c87efc7",
                                                "sense_id": "1fac5e31-e1a2-3273-a787-8b19aa5dd850",
                                                "text": "I'm gonna get them doors open if it harelips everybody on Bear Creek!"
